  "notes": [
    "Race, long jump and high jump depend on age: up to 30, above 30 to 40, above 40 (para 12.13, 12.16). Stored as age_max 30, age_min 31 to age_max 40, age_min 41, using completed years; the notice does not say on which date age is counted for these bands.",
    "Jumps are in feet as in the notice: 3.75 means 3 feet 9 inches. Each jump may be tried three times (para 12.14).",
    "Only candidates who qualify the race go on to the jumps, and only those who pass endurance are measured (para 12.14, 12.15.1).",
    "Relaxations: men 5 cm height and chest for hill areas, ST, and sons of Delhi Police personnel; women 2 cm height for hill areas and SC/ST, 5 cm for daughters of Delhi Police personnel. Chest is not measured for women."
